[CENTER][SIZE=6][B]Expressive Launcher 3.0.9 — Seamless Pro Activation & Polished Licensing[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][I]Official Release Announcement & Download Links[/I][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

Welcome to Expressive Launcher 3.0.9 (Build 41)! This release delivers crucial enhancements to the Expressive Pro activation experience, introducing smart transaction validation, an offline support fallback flow, and 1-tap assistance for supporters.

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]✨ What's New & Fixed[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Resilient Pro License Activation[/B]: Resolved connection errors when verifying PayPal donations. Online verification timeouts and server maintenance states now gracefully fall back to our instant offline licensing path.
[*][B]1-Tap Email Support for Offline Keys[/B]: If automated online verification is temporarily unavailable, the Redeem Pro dialog now provides a 1-tap [B]"Email Support for Pro Key"[/B] button that pre-populates your Device ID and Transaction ID directly to [ICODE]daryldenson0405@gmail.com[/ICODE] for immediate key issuance.
[*][B]Quick Copy Details Action[/B]: Added a 1-tap [B]"Copy Details"[/B] button so users can instantly copy their Device ID and transaction information to the clipboard for sharing on XDA, Telegram, or email.
[*][B]Smart Input Detection & Safety Guards[/B]:
[*][B]Donation Button ID Detection[/B]: Detects if a user inadvertently enters the hosted PayPal button ID ([ICODE]9RB3TYYQ6FWE2[/ICODE]) and provides clear instructions on where to find their 17-character PayPal receipt ID.
[*][B]License Key Auto-Redemption[/B]: If an offline license key ([ICODE]EXPR-PRO-...[/ICODE]) is pasted into the transaction verification field, the launcher automatically recognizes it and activates your Pro license immediately.
[*][B]Corrected Placeholder Hint[/B]: Updated the transaction field hint to specify the 17-character format from PayPal receipts (e.g. [ICODE]5Y6345678A1234567[/ICODE]), eliminating confusion with donation link IDs.
[*][B]Always-Visible Support Card[/B]: The [I]Donate & Unlock[/I] tab now features a dedicated support card ensuring paying supporters always have a clear, immediate way to reach developer assistance.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]💎 Expressive Pro & Free Core[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Free Core (Always Supported & Ad-Free)[/B]:
[*]Clean, fluid Android 17 Pixel experience with 100% Pixel parity, private space support, and Google Discover feed integration via Expressive Feed Companion.
[*][B]Expressive Pro ($4.99 One-Time)[/B]:
[*]Unlocks deep personalization including custom grid sizing, typography, gesture mapping, dock styling, and per-app icon overrides.
[*][I]Expressive Pro is a one-time $4.99 contribution. Every dollar directly funds automated CI/CD servers, Android 17 test devices, cryptographic signing pipelines, and continuous active development.[/I]

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

